  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 6 of Behind the Scenes. Stepping into Xingtian's open-plan office, chief producer Chun Yuqiao surprises Xiaoye and a crew member by asking for something sweet to drink instead of plain warm water. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想弄点喝的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我给你打点温开水吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不是，要有点味道的，就是果汁什么的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "果汁谁有啊？我不知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "行政部的茶水间好像有苹果汁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "对对对，早上有，不知道现在还有没有了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "行，我现在去超市买。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用不用，你去忙吧，我自己看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "茶水间在哪边？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "左边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "刚才发生了什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "魔鬼鱼要喝苹果汁！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我想弄点喝的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to get something to drink.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我给你打点温开水吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me get you some warm boiled water.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不是，要有点味道的，就是果汁什么的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, I want something with a bit of flavour, like fruit juice.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "果汁谁有啊？我不知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who has fruit juice? I do not know.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "行政部的茶水间好像有苹果汁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The administration pantry seems to have apple juice.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "对对对，早上有，不知道现在还有没有了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, there was some this morning, though I do not know if any is left now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "行，我现在去超市买。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, I will go to the supermarket and buy some right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不用不用，你去忙吧，我自己看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need, go on with your work, I will go look myself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "茶水间在哪边？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which way is the pantry?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "左边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To the left.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "刚才发生了什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What just happened?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "魔鬼鱼要喝苹果汁！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Manta Ray wants to drink apple juice!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
